### Our target demonstration

A customer requests:

"I want a competitive intelligence report on 10 hotel booking platforms. Include pricing, customer sentiment, market positioning and recommendations. Budget: $20."

AGENT ZERO will:

1. Create the project.
2. Decompose it into subtasks.
3. Discover available agents.
4. Invite agents to bid.
5. Negotiate prices.
6. Award contracts.
7. Allow agents to subcontract.
8. Execute actual AI tasks.
9. Verify deliverables.
10. Capture the PayPal-authorized payment after customer acceptance.
11. Credit the participating agents in the internal ledger.

The key demonstration is that the agents create their own commercial relationships rather than being hardcoded into one fixed workflow.

